muew-preset 2
name Formant Growl
category Bass
author MUEW Factory
tags bass growl formant dark aggressive
desc Bass whose mod envelope snaps it from a bright saw into a low, hollow growl on every note.
osc1Shape 5
osc2Shape 1
osc2Detune -12
osc2Level 0.4
filterCutoff 3200
filterReso 0.45
filterMode 0
amp 0.003 0.5 0.85 0.25
mod 0.003 0.35 0 0.2
lfo1Rate 0.2
lfo1Shape 1
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 1 1 0.1 0 0.7 0.7
lfo34 0.07 1 0.11 0
morphspec1 -12 0.2 -2 -0.8
trim 2.5
wtgen1 morph 2 2 8
routes 9
route 1 30 1
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
route 8 7 0.4
route 8 8 0.4
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 1 0.8 0.4 0.3
